	'k6445ff3a' => '6 × 45 min',
	'k64586fcc' => 'Claire handles first calls, schedules initial assessments within two weeks, and issues itemised receipts for insurers. She ensures that every client and family experiences a smooth, welcoming entry to the clinic.',
	'k6510d9b5' => 'Therapy block and regular review',
	'k663a7d02' => 'A free 15-minute call comes first. New clients are seen within 2 weeks of that call.',
